he matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ha=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4\\cdot 7+2\\cdot 3 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}34 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ha=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}34 \\\\ -3\\cdot 7+6\\cdot 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}34 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$Ha=\\begin{bmatrix}34 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299698 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff414112-3be2-5b9c-9ded-5025ea05c2b4" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a 2x2 Matrix by a Column Vector"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d6511398-87a7-5a97-9019-de163bcd8589" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298471}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d6511398-87a7-5a97-9019-de163bcd8589" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298471} :answer-field/id #uuid "4ce02690-633e-5560-854e-b877f4b6e53a" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298894} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00ceebbc-8a68-5fa8-98d9-171cf8eb58b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297552}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "00ceebbc-8a68-5fa8-98d9-171cf8eb58b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297552} :answer-field/id #uuid "b74a3435-80b0-56da-9d2d-54a2017fc702" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299255}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident